3fx|v|To speak or write by way of return (originally, to a charge), or in reply; to make response. ; To make a satisfactory response or return. ; To render account, or to be responsible; to be accountable; to make amends; as, the man must answer to his employer for the money intrusted to his care. ; To be or act in return. ; To be or act by way of compliance, fulfillment, reciprocation, or satisfaction; to serve the purpose; as, gypsum answers as a manure on some soils. ; To be opposite, or to act in opposition. ; To be or act as an equivalent, or as adequate or sufficient; as, a very few will answer. ; To be or act in conformity, or by way of accommodation, correspondence, relation, or proportion; to conform; to correspond; to suit; -- usually with to.	s:ov5,6,1~ov5,6,1	d:23pf,37,14~23pf,37,14	D:10oi,6,8;z6a,5,4~10oi,6,8;z6a,5,4
